{=1}So

00:10:39.750 --> 00:10:45.330
You and I were likely the only ones
in the Middle Kingdom to realize as much.

00:10:45.330 --> 00:10:49.370
It would have made no difference
to a big country like So,

00:10:49.370 --> 00:10:53.330
but it would be bad news
for your nations to be gobbled up by Chin.

00:10:55.700 --> 00:11:00.790
And that's why you put together
this coalition army.

00:11:00.790 --> 00:11:07.660
Right. I couldn't imagine Chin--
Shou Hei Kun going to such lengths.

00:11:07.660 --> 00:11:10.660
It's quite the complicated tale.

00:11:10.660 --> 00:11:13.950
How so, imbecile? It's clear as day, moron.

00:11:13.950 --> 00:11:15.120
Wha--

00:11:15.120 --> 00:11:19.620
I pity the people of Chin,
destroyed while unaware.

00:11:23.540 --> 00:11:25.750
Who cares about that?

00:11:25.750 --> 00:11:30.750
If they resent anything, let them resent
being born in Chin. This is war!

00:11:30.750 --> 00:11:33.750
Get carried away and slip up--you're history!

00:11:33.750 --> 00:11:36.290
That's how it goes in these times of ours!

00:11:42.050 --> 00:11:44.800
"Gyoku"                                                                "Gaku"

00:11:42.200 --> 00:11:43.750
Mou Ten! Ou Hon!

00:11:45.120 --> 00:11:46.540
Go on ahead!

00:11:46.540 --> 00:11:47.870
Sir!

00:11:47.870 --> 00:11:50.620
Where are you two assigned?

00:11:50.620 --> 00:11:53.910
To Mou Bu's and Tou's allied army. You?

00:11:53.910 --> 00:11:56.950
I'm with Lord Hyou.

00:11:56.950 --> 00:11:59.450
Both pretty quirky armies, huh.

00:12:01.160 --> 00:12:04.250
Things really have gotten crazy.

00:12:04.250 --> 00:12:09.040
Seems like just yesterday we were storming
Sanyou and who knows where else.

00:12:09.040 --> 00:12:11.580
A blunder at the highest level.

00:12:11.580 --> 00:12:13.910
Nah...

00:12:13.910 --> 00:12:15.410
These <i>are</i> warring states, right?

00:12:19.660 --> 00:12:21.250
True.

00:12:21.250 --> 00:12:22.450
Ou Hon.

00:12:22.450 --> 00:12:25.200
Heard you command 3,000 troops now.

00:12:25.200 --> 00:12:27.970
Well, con- <i>grat</i> -u- <i>la</i> -tions!

00:12:27.970 --> 00:12:29.700
Save it.

00:12:29.700 --> 00:12:33.450
I'll have 3,000 under me after this war!

00:12:33.450 --> 00:12:35.500
Here we go again.

00:12:35.500 --> 00:12:37.540
<i>I'm</i> aiming to be a 5,000-man commander.

00:12:39.160 --> 00:12:40.080
Fi--

00:12:40.080 --> 00:12:42.830
And the only thing higher than that...

00:12:42.830 --> 00:12:44.120
...is general.

00:12:46.040 --> 00:12:48.410
Ge... General...

00:12:49.500 --> 00:12:51.790
Later, battalion commander.

00:12:53.160 --> 00:12:57.620
And with the fate of the country
hangin' in the balance...

00:12:57.620 --> 00:13:02.580
Forget bein' a 5,000-man commander--
I'm gonna make <i>general</i> !

00:13:02.580 --> 00:13:04.790
Not happening.

00:13:04.790 --> 00:13:08.750
I better get going, too.
Father will give me an earful if I'm late.

00:13:11.660 --> 00:13:12.700
Mou Ten!

00:13:15.120 --> 00:13:17.290
Let's give this everything we've got!

00:13:17.290 --> 00:13:19.870
And no matter what... don't die.

00:13:22.080 --> 00:13:23.700
Sheesh.

00:13:23.700 --> 00:13:27.830
Here I thought we'd all hole up
in here and fight together.

00:13:27.830 --> 00:13:31.790
Don't be ridiculous.
That's just what they'd expect us to do.

00:13:31.790 --> 00:13:34.040
Kankoku Pass may be impenetrable,

00:13:34.040 --> 00:13:37.250
but the surrounding mountains
are full of gaps to hide in.

00:13:37.250 --> 00:13:42.200
We're out there guarding
those and diverting the foe.

00:13:42.200 --> 00:13:44.080
The foe, meanwhile, knows this--

00:13:44.080 --> 00:13:48.580
so the coalition army, too,
is stationed over a wide area.

00:13:48.580 --> 00:13:51.540
Are you saying that you and I,
being stationed here,

00:13:51.540 --> 00:13:53.700
drew the winning ticket?

00:13:53.700 --> 00:13:58.370
No one knows if it's winning
or not until the fighting begins.

00:13:59.730 --> 00:14:01.730
"Sho"

00:14:07.620 --> 00:14:08.790
Here they come.

00:14:15.370 --> 00:14:15.410
{=11}Ou Sen army

00:14:15.370 --> 00:14:15.410
