00:14:49.910 --> 00:14:51.910
Kanyou

00:15:02.040 --> 00:15:03.500
Are you okay, Kou?

00:15:03.500 --> 00:15:04.700
Ow, ow, ow...

00:15:04.700 --> 00:15:05.910
Now look here!

00:15:05.910 --> 00:15:10.870
She's carrying His Highness's baby!
What if something happened?

00:15:10.870 --> 00:15:14.120
It's okay--I protected my belly.

00:15:14.120 --> 00:15:19.080
Things certainly have gotten frantic
here at the Inner Palace...

00:15:19.080 --> 00:15:22.660
Everyone's packing so they can
leave at a moment's notice.

00:15:22.660 --> 00:15:26.910
Being locked away like this
has only let awful rumors spread.

00:15:26.910 --> 00:15:30.580
Huh? But hasn't the enemy surrounded Kanyou?

00:15:30.580 --> 00:15:32.250
They have not!

00:15:32.250 --> 00:15:34.870
The coalition army's only come
as far as Kankoku Pass!

00:15:34.870 --> 00:15:39.910
As long as they don't make it past that,
they can't reach Kanyou.

00:15:39.910 --> 00:15:42.250
You sure know a lot, You.

00:15:42.250 --> 00:15:45.080
I'm from a military family.

00:15:45.080 --> 00:15:48.540
But Father did send me that letter,

00:15:48.540 --> 00:15:52.000
saying Kankoku Pass was in danger,
that I should find a way out of the Inner Palace

00:15:52.000 --> 00:15:54.910
while I still could.

00:15:54.910 --> 00:15:58.250
Um, You?

00:15:58.250 --> 00:16:03.000
If the enemy does manage to come
all the way to the Inner Palace...

00:16:03.000 --> 00:16:05.620
we court ladies will probably...

00:16:05.620 --> 00:16:07.290
A-And His Highness's baby...

00:16:09.250 --> 00:16:13.870
If anything happens, I'll keep you
<i>and</i> your baby safe, no matter what.

00:16:13.870 --> 00:16:15.620
Oh, You...

00:16:19.080 --> 00:16:20.950
She's shaking.

00:16:20.950 --> 00:16:24.200
Even You is shaking.

00:16:24.200 --> 00:16:25.370
It--

00:16:25.370 --> 00:16:28.120
It's all right, You!

00:16:28.120 --> 00:16:31.410
There are people fighting for us at Kankoku Pass.

00:16:31.410 --> 00:16:33.540
It'll be okay!

00:16:33.540 --> 00:16:36.830
Chin's soldiers are really strong.

00:16:36.830 --> 00:16:38.450
I know...

00:16:38.450 --> 00:16:40.620
I just know they'll protect us all!

00:16:43.980 --> 00:16:46.400
The 120,000-Man Sho Army

00:16:46.830 --> 00:16:49.540
The Sho army... 120,000 strong...

00:16:49.540 --> 00:16:52.040
Is that who we're going to be up against?

00:16:52.040 --> 00:16:53.580
All 50,000 of us...

00:16:53.580 --> 00:16:55.910
That's 40,000, dummy.

00:16:55.910 --> 00:16:56.950
En.

00:16:58.870 --> 00:17:00.540
The Sho army...

00:17:00.540 --> 00:17:02.450
Ain't seen them since Bayou.

00:17:03.580 --> 00:17:05.160
No.

00:17:05.160 --> 00:17:09.370
Back then, we were a 100-man squadron.
Now we're a 1,000-man battalion.

00:17:12.370 --> 00:17:14.250
Ou Ki...

00:17:14.250 --> 00:17:19.620
You named the Hi Shin Force--
and we've grown so much in these three years.

00:17:19.620 --> 00:17:22.660
Keep your eyes peeled
and watchin' us closely, now!

00:17:23.350 --> 00:17:25.560
"Hyou"

00:17:28.290 --> 00:17:29.700
Lord Hyou...

00:17:33.900 --> 00:17:34.240
{=6}The 60,000-Man Mou Bu Army

00:17:33.900 --> 00:17:34.150
{=5}The 30,000-Man Tou Army

00:17:33.990 --> 00:17:36.320
{=6}The 60,000-Man Mou Bu Army

00:17:33.990 --> 00:17:36.320
{=5}The 30,000-Man Tou Army

00:17:36.570 --> 00:17:38.820
The 150,000-Man So Army

00:17:36.790 --> 00:17:39.080
A hundred-fifty thousand...

00:17:39.080 --> 00:17:42.080
I'd hoped we wouldn't wind up with So.

00:17:49.210 --> 00:17:52.040
Kankoku Pass

00:17:50.090 --> 00:17:52.040
The 100,000-Man Gi Army

00:17:50.090 --> 00:17:52.040
The 50,000-Man Kan Army

00:17:52.250 --> 00:17:56.410
Come on, what's the big deal?
Let's get started already!

00:17:57.970 --> 00:18:00.220
"Kan"

00:18:04.470 --> 00:18:06.520
The 70,000-Man Ou Sen Army

00:18:08.810 --> 00:18:11.270
The 120,000-Man En Army

00:18:11.620 --> 00:18:13.410
Ordo, sir!

00:18:13.410 --> 00:18:15.750
Looking at the mountains
behind Ou Sen's army,

00:18:15.750 --> 00:18:20.120
it appears we can approach Kankoku Pass
from the side or from the rear.

00:18:20.120 --> 00:18:25.500
Most definitely. I see the same
paths in the shapes of those peaks.

00:18:25.500 --> 00:18:27.370
Shall we, then?

00:18:27.370 --> 00:18:31.620
Wait, Yukii.
It's not for us to start this war.

00:18:31.620 --> 00:18:32.700
Huh?

00:18:32.700 --> 00:18:37.500
Politics, my boy, politics!
Inevitable in a huge war like this.

00:18:39.620 --> 00:18:41.620
Apologies, Ri Boku.

00:18:41.510 --> 00:18:45.470
Coalition Army Headquarters

00:18:41.620 --> 00:18:46.200
The King of So is particular about
who signals the start of combat.

00:18:46.200 --> 00:18:49.450
It's only natural for a great country
to consider appearances.

00:18:49.450 --> 00:18:50.950
By all means, go ahead.

00:18:52.250 --> 00:18:55.450
Don't mind if I do.

00:18:55.450 --> 00:18:57.290
Have Kan Mei kick things off!

00:19:05.290 --> 00:19:10.660
A message to all So troops from So
commanding general Kan Mei!

00:19:10.660 --> 00:19:16.830
We, the So army, have been granted
the honor of starting this war!

00:19:16.830 --> 00:19:19.910
Yow! What's with that loud-ass voice?!

00:19:19.910 --> 00:19:21.910
From one whole battlefield over!

00:19:21.910 --> 00:19:25.700
With this war, Chin will perish!

00:19:27.290 --> 00:19:29.500
Make no mistake:

00:19:29.500 --> 00:19:34.290
This war will leave a bold mark
in the annals of history!

00:19:35.790 --> 00:19:39.870
And now, the honorable gentleman
who will begin this war...

00:19:41.450 --> 00:19:44.160
Rin Bu Kun!

00:19:44.160 --> 00:19:45.540
Sir!

00:19:45.540 --> 00:19:46.910
We're the vanguard!

00:19:46.910 --> 00:19:49.040
Here we go!

00:19:49.040 --> 00:19:53.870
I am the mighty So general Rin Bu Kun!

00:19:55.790 --> 00:19:56.910
Rin Bu Kun?

00:19:58.120 --> 00:19:59.910
That's right:

00:19:59.910 --> 00:20:02.580
the man who killed Dou Kin.

00:20:02.580 --> 00:20:08.450
And I am the one who will lift
the curtain on this magnificent war!

00:20:08.450 --> 00:20:11.200
Who sets the very earth a-tremble?

00:20:11.200 --> 00:20:12.410
The So army!

00:20:12.410 --> 00:20:15.580
Who makes the very heavens quake?

00:20:15.580 --> 00:20:17.080
The So army!

00:20:17.080 --> 00:20:18.830
Sink that Chin army!

00:20:20.660 --> 00:20:21.870
All troops!

00:20:21.870 --> 00:20:23.950
Charge!

00:20:23.950 --> 00:20:25.540
Cha... huh?

00:20:29.580 --> 00:20:31.790
Follow the general!

00:20:33.120 --> 00:20:35.370
Wh-What's going on?!

00:20:35.370 --> 00:20:39.040
Gotta hand it to Lord Hyou.
That's what <i>I'm</i> talkin' about!

00:20:39.040 --> 00:20:41.250
After him, troops!

00:20:43.160 --> 00:20:45.200
Charge, Hi Shin Force!

00:20:45.200 --> 00:20:51.080
We're gonna be the ones
who get this war started!

00:20:51.080 --> 00:20:53.790
Lord Hyou's army got the jump on them.

00:20:53.790 --> 00:20:55.540
That guy just kept yammering on.

00:20:59.070 --> 00:21:01.820
Sho Central Army

00:20:59.120 --> 00:21:02.000
Ri Haku, sir! The Chin army
 has been mobilized!

00:21:04.120 --> 00:21:08.160
They knocked the wind
right out of Kan Mei's sails!

00:21:08.160 --> 00:21:12.330
Seems there's at least one
Chin commander with a sense of humor.

00:21:15.790 --> 00:21:17.410
It's no good--we can't catch up!

00:21:17.410 --> 00:21:20.290
Here they come! Ready your spears!

00:21:20.290 --> 00:21:21.910
We kill them first!

00:21:23.160 --> 00:21:25.200
Smash on through, Lord Hyou!

00:21:28.870 --> 00:21:30.290
Ha-hah!

00:21:34.270 --> 00:21:36.730
Kei Sha - 20,000

00:21:34.270 --> 00:21:36.730
Man Goku - 20,000

00:21:34.270 --> 00:21:36.730
Ri Haku - 60,000

00:21:34.270 --> 00:21:36.730
Kou Son Ryuu - 20,000

00:21:34.270 --> 00:21:36.730
Lord Hyou - 40,000

00:21:39.000 --> 00:21:41.290
Just... stay alive, everyone.

00:21:41.290 --> 00:21:42.950
Let's go, gang!

00:21:42.950 --> 00:21:44.950
This is payback for Bayou!

00:21:45.910 --> 00:21:48.750
Bring it on, Chin mountain monkeys!

00:21:48.750 --> 00:21:51.620
We're the Hi Shin Force, damn you!

00:21:55.000 --> 00:21:58.450
Ri Haku, sir! Our first unit
is taking heavy damage!

00:22:05.450 --> 00:22:08.410
Kan Mei, sir... perhaps we should...

00:22:10.620 --> 00:22:13.620
What an utter humiliation!

00:22:13.620 --> 00:22:18.750
They have sullied the honor
of the So army, Rin Bu Kun!

00:22:18.750 --> 00:22:21.080
Leave this to me!

00:22:21.080 --> 00:22:27.620
We'll slaughter Chin's troops
and stain the earth with their blood!

00:22:27.620 --> 00:22:31.700
Heroic warriors of So! Move out!

00:22:34.290 --> 00:22:35.540
Here we go.

00:22:36.870 --> 00:22:38.790
The So army is on the move!

00:22:38.790 --> 00:22:40.950
The time is ripe.

00:22:40.950 --> 00:22:44.000
The Kan army has mobilized, too!

00:22:44.000 --> 00:22:47.620
All that silly fuss over who starts it...

00:22:47.620 --> 00:22:51.250
It hardly matters. <i>We</i> are the stars of this war.

00:22:51.250 --> 00:22:55.660
Move out, Gi army!
Approach Kankoku Pass, the gateway to Chin...

00:22:55.660 --> 00:22:57.120
...and crush it!

00:22:59.040 --> 00:23:00.120
Here they come!

00:23:04.410 --> 00:23:08.330
Now, then. What say <i>we</i> get started,

00:23:08.330 --> 00:23:10.500
eh, Ou Sen?

00:23:14.120 --> 00:23:18.580
In 241 BCE, the coalition army
went up against the army of Chin.

00:23:18.580 --> 00:23:21.870
The Battle of Kankoku Pass had begun.

